WEBVTT

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:39.090
The place they arrive at is a thousand years ago in Abenobashi Shopping...

00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:41.860
No, there isn't even a bridge, much less a shopping arcade.

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:43.370
It's just plain Abeno.

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:46.040
When you think of Abeno, you think of Abeno Seimei.

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:49.330
Eutus' true identity was that famous Onmyou mystic.

00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:51.470
So, what we've found out so far...

00:01:51.470 --> 00:01:56.130
One: The mysterious incidents that have happened thus far were all Eutus' fault.

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:59.590
Two: Mune-mune is Sasshi's grandma!

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:04.470
Three: If they go back to their original world, Grandpa Masa will be dead. Whoa!

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:06.650
That third one is especially heavy there.

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:08.730
Faced with this shocking truth...

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:11.330
...what will grade school kid Sasshi's next move be?

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:12.950
He can't possibly tell Arumi.

00:02:36.020 --> 00:02:37.420
Hey, wait for me!

00:02:40.020 --> 00:02:40.920
Namiko-san...

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:41.890
Akira-san...

00:02:45.630 --> 00:02:46.750
I'm so bored.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:50.090
And there's nothing good on TV, either.

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:53.100
Ho! Takonoushi has managed to hang in there at the edge of the ring!

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:54.150
Dohyou!

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:58.900
So, this week's theme will be men's arts and crafts.

00:02:59.110 --> 00:02:59.990
Shugei!

00:03:00.810 --> 00:03:02.310
In other words, you are saying that the starting point...

00:03:02.310 --> 00:03:03.780
...for various forms of artistic expression was imitation.

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:04.800
Mohou!

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:07.050
You guys ain't funny!

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:15.120
Oh, the TV was my last hope!

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:18.090
This is bad.

00:03:18.730 --> 00:03:21.200
I'm gonna die of boredom!

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:30.390
Hello, Arumi-chan!

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:32.190
Sasshi!

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:34.110
And how are you today?

00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:37.700
What's Sasshi doing on television? What's that stupid looking outfit?

00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:40.700
My, my, Arumi-chan, you seem to be in a foul mood.

00:03:41.050 --> 00:03:42.480
You can hear what I'm saying?

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:45.030
Of course, I can hear you. Because I am...

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:49.090
I felt like I hadn't been fair to ya, but when I came back...

00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:53.250
...you weren't there and I didn't see the Mister or any goblins around!

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:54.580
You got any idea what a tough time I've had here?!

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:57.670
That's why I...

00:03:58.130 --> 00:04:01.010
If you've got the time to be making excuses, hurry up and do something!

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:03.900
I know that. Quit hurrying me.

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:05.340
'Course I'm in a hurry!

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:08.400
Day after day, I've been stuck in this stupid world all by myself...

00:04:11.210 --> 00:04:12.390
...staring at the TV until my eyes glazed over!

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:13.600
It's done!

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:16.770
Hey!

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:20.090
What're ya doing? Cut it out!

00:04:33.970 --> 00:04:35.200
We're here!

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:37.420
What the hell d'you do to me?!

00:04:52.950 --> 00:04:55.600
What the heck is that gaudy, cheap looking castle?

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:57.060
A store selling glasses?

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:58.270
Non, non, non.

00:04:59.530 --> 00:05:01.390
Not again?

00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:03.030
Non, non.

00:05:03.470 --> 00:05:08.160
This is a fantastic fairy tale land for mademoiselle to enjoy.

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:09.940
Fairy tale?

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:09.950
Oui.

00:05:10.770 --> 00:05:11.760
This way.

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:16.480
Kyapiryun!

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:17.570
Kyariryun!

00:05:18.050 --> 00:05:19.560
Congratulations!

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:22.110
You are Sasshiland's very first visitor!

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:23.630
Yay!

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:25.140
Sasshiland?

00:05:30.590 --> 00:05:32.160
To start with, here's your supplementary prize...

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:33.650
...of a year's supply of the latest video game consoles!

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:39.270
What d'you mean, a year's supply? Just one'll last ya for years.

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:41.260
A year's supply of LCD TVs.

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:43.530
A year's supply of PCs.

00:05:43.650 --> 00:05:45.740
A year's supply of rare uniforms.

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:47.950
A year's supply of luxury sports cars.

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:54.550
A year's supply this, a year's supply that...

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:55.790
You guys must be morons.

00:05:56.220 --> 00:05:58.120
Where's that moron Sasshi?!

00:05:58.590 --> 00:05:59.690
Je ne sais pas.

00:05:59.690 --> 00:06:01.320
Getting all these girls together!

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:02.800
This world sure seems like something that moron'd think up!

00:06:03.320 --> 00:06:06.290
You sure as hell ain't getting away with it this time!

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:09.800
She's mad for some reason.

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:12.200
I thought she'd be happy for sure if I did all that for her.

00:06:12.570 --> 00:06:14.940
I wonder what it was that rubbed her the wrong way?

00:06:14.940 --> 00:06:16.900
I just don't understand girls.

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:20.570
Well, it can't be helped. Let's move on to plan H-6.

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:21.520
Roger that!

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:28.110
What kinda sensibility is this? It hurts my eyes.

00:06:28.850 --> 00:06:30.240
Hello and welcome, hop.

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:32.310
Kouhei-san?

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:37.730
I've got sweet candy, sweet cotton candy, and sweet ice cream.

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:39.360
Which would you like, hop?

00:06:39.360 --> 00:06:41.900
"Hop"? Well, not that it matters.

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:44.630
Say, Kouhei-san, have ya seen Sasshi?

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:45.970
Katsura?

00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:46.510
Sasshi!

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:48.560
Welcome!

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:50.720
No, no, you don't gotta do that.

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:54.010
Welcome!

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:58.430
This is more shamelessly gaudy than the ol' ladies of Osaka.

00:06:59.180 --> 00:07:00.670
It's making my head spin.

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:07.530
No!

00:07:08.120 --> 00:07:09.490
Take care!

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:13.030
What the heck?! I said I don't wanna go!

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:17.040
But this world's even worse than the ones we've already been to.

00:07:17.570 --> 00:07:18.530
Ya think so?

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:22.700
But I'm going to make sure you have tons of fun from here on out!

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:23.940
Aren't you just looking forward to it?

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:25.170
This ain't fun.

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:27.180
Are ya right in the head?

00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:28.480
You were stupid to begin with...

00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:30.540
...but you sure your brain is not rotting with worms growing inside?

00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:33.440
Wearing that weird outfit, and that goofy look on your face.

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:35.350
Don't say my face looks goofy!

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:37.440
Besides, where the heck are you right now?

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:41.180
The place that controls this world!

00:07:41.590 --> 00:07:42.650
Control?

00:07:44.260 --> 00:07:45.760
How's that?! You surprised now?!

00:07:46.160 --> 00:07:47.230
Bekachu?

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:48.190
Huh?

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:51.030
Oh, wrong one! This isn't it, either. Let's see...

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:52.860
Here!

00:07:53.970 --> 00:07:55.120
Don't fall asleep!

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:56.560
Huh? So, what?

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:59.240
Here, here, here! An Onmyou mystic license!

00:07:59.240 --> 00:08:02.980
I can now use hitogata to cast magic, come and go to other worlds...

00:08:02.980 --> 00:08:05.880
...and do lots of other stuff like create worlds!

00:08:06.180 --> 00:08:07.180
Really?

00:08:07.180 --> 00:08:08.620
So? Are ya surprised?

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:10.910
Well, you just do whatever you wanna do.

00:08:11.390 --> 00:08:13.090
I'm not interested in that stuff anyway.

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:15.160
What?! This is where you're supposed to be more surprised!

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:16.350
Don't you get it?!

00:08:16.490 --> 00:08:19.090
Like seeing how an Onmyou mystic's dressed and shrieking 'bout how cool he is.

00:08:19.090 --> 00:08:21.030
Your outfit's so stupid looking.

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:23.430
Don't say it's a stupid outfit!

00:08:23.430 --> 00:08:24.300
Listen closely.

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:28.600
This is an excellent costume based on geomancy and mystical physics!

00:08:29.870 --> 00:08:31.570
Its first surprising feature is...

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:33.610
...the number of hitogata that you can carry with you at all times!

00:08:33.980 --> 00:08:35.640
An amazing 50 hitogata!

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:38.340
This is 1.5 times more than previous costumes!

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:42.610
Did you hear me? 1.5 times more! Furthermore...

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:45.510
Even the Demon's Gate and Rear Demon's Gate are at your disposal.

00:08:45.590 --> 00:08:48.090
This all-directional gyroscope is a standard feature!

00:08:48.390 --> 00:08:51.120
Not only that, its size is adjustable...

00:08:51.230 --> 00:08:53.630
...and it has extra urethane, making it excellently airtight!

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:55.960
On top of which, here you are!

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:58.920
It's reversible!

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:02.520
I told ya not to fall asleep!

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:05.140
I get you.

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:07.480
So, you've become an honest-to-goodness Onmyou mystic, right?

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:08.680
That's right!

00:09:08.680 --> 00:09:11.770
Then how 'bout hurrying up and sending us back to our own world?

00:09:11.950 --> 00:09:14.470
Well, I could do that, but...

00:09:15.180 --> 00:09:18.810
I thought I'd get you to enjoy this world first!

00:09:19.020 --> 00:09:21.990
I'm not enjoying it at all! I don't wanna be here one bit!

00:09:22.490 --> 00:09:26.260
What?! But it's such a fun place! Why not?!

00:09:26.860 --> 00:09:29.160
I guess it's still not enough.

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:32.960
All right, Arumi-chan, I'll take you to an even more fun world!

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:36.840
Oh, hey, Sasshi! I told ya I don't want this!

00:09:39.840 --> 00:09:40.870
What the?

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:44.770
No! I don't wanna go!

00:09:45.450 --> 00:09:47.440
Girl, what are you doing?!

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:51.150
Gracious! And you're dressed so pretty!

00:09:51.450 --> 00:09:52.920
Pretty?

00:09:52.920 --> 00:09:54.110
Get yourself over here!

00:09:54.220 --> 00:09:56.920
Huh? What? Excuse me...

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:02.820
At this rate, I probably should have plan N-3 ready too.

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:06.720
Let's see, let's see...

00:10:08.070 --> 00:10:09.040
Found it!

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:11.900
"Use hitogata and make them do all sorts of things."

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:15.710
First, once you've decided on the hitogata to use...

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:18.540
You set it and...

00:10:21.280 --> 00:10:23.100
I see, I see.

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:57.130
Do you hear me?! Have everything cleaned before the end of the day!

00:10:57.390 --> 00:11:00.380
Um, I don't really wanna do any of this or anything...

00:11:02.590 --> 00:11:04.830
So now it's a Cinderella game?

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:06.790
Honestly, it's one thing after another...

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:13.940
Oh, poor, poor Arumiderella.

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:16.540
Treated cruelly by your evil stepmother...

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:19.060
...you are not even allowed to go to the ball, are you?

00:11:19.270 --> 00:11:23.270
I shall use my magic now and send you to that ball!

00:11:23.340 --> 00:11:24.640
Don't want it.

00:11:25.110 --> 00:11:26.980
Now, don't say that.

00:11:26.980 --> 00:11:28.610
I don't want what I don't want!

00:11:29.450 --> 00:11:32.690
Normally, this is where everyone becomes really happy.

00:11:32.690 --> 00:11:33.960
Oh, I know!

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:36.130
If you go to the ball, you will meet the prince!

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:37.560
I don't wanna meet him at all.

00:11:37.560 --> 00:11:39.690
You will receive a year's supply of glass slippers!

00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:41.010
Don't need 'em.

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:46.030
This is a problem. We can't move things along at this rate.

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:48.470
Well, I'm gonna go home.

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:49.140
You're going home?!

00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:50.630
You can't go home!

00:11:50.910 --> 00:11:52.530
What's with that outfit?

00:11:52.970 --> 00:11:57.570
I'm the prince. If you won't come see me, the story won't move along!

00:11:58.310 --> 00:12:01.150
There's no way in hell I'd be happy doing stupid things like this!

00:12:01.150 --> 00:12:03.120
What are ya trying to pull here?!

00:12:03.550 --> 00:12:06.520
Stupid... Well, sure, maybe it is, but...

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:10.890
You were saying you wanted to do Cinderella for Performing Arts Day at school, so...

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:12.330
You know!

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:14.730
Would ya quit doing things that are as stupid as offering teacakes...

00:12:14.730 --> 00:12:17.660
...to someone bleeding his guts out and about to die?!

00:12:17.830 --> 00:12:20.330
I see, I see, I see.

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:21.340
What d'you mean?

00:12:22.900 --> 00:12:25.720
If ya keep doing these stupid things forever, you'll see heavenly punishment someday!

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:27.700
I'm not afraid of heavenly punishment!

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:30.540
After all, I'm an honest-to-goodness Onmyou mystic.

00:12:30.780 --> 00:12:34.150
Bring it on! Arrows, guns, teddy bears, whatever you have!

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:44.460
What's a bear doing here?

00:12:44.790 --> 00:12:46.380
Oh, that hurt.

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:06.470
What's going on? Sasshi?!

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:09.610
Let's see, when a hitogata has frozen up...

00:13:10.020 --> 00:13:10.890
Wrong!

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:12.720
"Did you forget to do this?"

00:13:13.090 --> 00:13:14.520
Not that!

00:13:14.760 --> 00:13:17.930
If you're making out in a park and someone suddenly addresses you from behind...

00:13:16.920 --> 00:13:19.790
You did something dumb again, didn't you?

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:20.110
...and when you turn around, you see the girl's father...

00:13:20.290 --> 00:13:22.230
No, no, no!

00:13:22.430 --> 00:13:24.370
Oh, is this the Onmyou mystic support center?

00:13:24.370 --> 00:13:25.870
I've got a big problem!

00:13:25.870 --> 00:13:27.950
What? The serial number?

00:13:29.940 --> 00:13:31.940
Not the one on the manual?

00:13:31.940 --> 00:13:34.000
The number on the box?

00:13:34.180 --> 00:13:36.040
I tossed that box first thing!

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:42.940
Why only me?

00:13:43.450 --> 00:13:45.470
How're ya gonna take care of that huge bear?

00:13:45.890 --> 00:13:47.680
I know! Plan H-7!

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:51.260
Arumi-chan, as an Onmyou mystic, I'll take care of it somehow...

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:54.160
...so would you buy me some time until I can?

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:57.350
Are ya seriously okay? You're acting a little weird.

00:14:09.210 --> 00:14:10.410
Oh, this is...

00:14:10.610 --> 00:14:12.210
Hewwo, there!

00:14:12.210 --> 00:14:13.310
What is this?

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:15.520
Never mind, just do what Henyasuke tells you to do!

00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:16.910
This thing's called Henyasuke?

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:18.920
Arumi-chan, transform, piro!

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:20.290
Huh?

00:14:21.560 --> 00:14:23.160
Now, use this wand...

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:26.960
...and borrow some magical power from the Kingdom of Ether, piro!

00:14:27.600 --> 00:14:29.000
Magical...

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:29.960
...power?

00:14:30.630 --> 00:14:34.540
I don't need that! I ain't doing any of this, you hear?!

00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:37.060
We don't have time for the incantation, so we'll abbreviate it, piro.

00:14:38.740 --> 00:14:40.020
Transform!

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:02.630
Arumicchi!

00:15:03.230 --> 00:15:06.670
Hey, quit moving my body without my permission!

00:15:06.670 --> 00:15:09.440
And what's with this? The cloth is flimsy stuff.

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:11.170
Where d'you buy something like this?

00:15:11.670 --> 00:15:13.440
I bought it from a thrift shop, piro.

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:15.710
That's not important! Now, get on this!

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:18.180
We have to hurry and save everyone, piro!

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:20.310
I've been telling you I don't wanna do this, haven't I?!

00:15:20.550 --> 00:15:21.850
Why do I gotta...

00:15:33.230 --> 00:15:34.910
I'm gonna throw up...

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:37.130
Now, defeat that bear!

00:15:37.530 --> 00:15:40.060
No way! What the hell am I supposed to do?!

00:15:40.400 --> 00:15:43.270
You'll just have to hold him here with your magic, piro!

00:15:43.270 --> 00:15:44.400
The incantation is...

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:48.310
Why do I gotta do something stupid like that?

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:50.380
Quit it, damn it!

00:15:50.780 --> 00:15:56.430
Something or other, whatever works, some platitudes, pararira poof!

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:01.910
Wow, Arumi-chan, that was amazing, piro!

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:04.020
You did all of it yourself.

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:24.040
It didn't work at all.

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:41.090
How was it, Arumi-chan? Did you enjoy yourself, piro?

00:16:43.660 --> 00:16:45.560
Sure, it was FUN!

00:16:47.740 --> 00:16:50.330
Oh, where is it? It should definitely be here.

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:54.540
Oh, here it is! Here it is! "When a hitogata goes out of control."

00:16:54.680 --> 00:16:56.110
What's it say?

00:16:56.110 --> 00:17:00.580
Once a hitogata has left its master's hands and goes out of control...

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:03.210
...there is no way to stop it.

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:08.580
That's garbage! What kinda manual is this?

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:11.550
Let's see, if you absolutely must stop it no matter what...

00:17:12.330 --> 00:17:13.630
Uh-huh, uh-huh...

00:17:14.460 --> 00:17:16.330
What?! No way!

00:17:21.400 --> 00:17:22.560
Oh, fine!

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:31.370
Okay, all of you, go!

00:17:31.810 --> 00:17:33.280
Yes, sir!

00:17:45.690 --> 00:17:46.820
And a one, two...

00:17:53.230 --> 00:17:54.440
It's ready!

00:17:54.440 --> 00:17:55.420
Okay!

00:17:57.470 --> 00:17:59.130
All things extant in this world...

00:17:59.940 --> 00:18:02.770
...gods of Heaven, gods of Earth, return them to the void.

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:06.210
Thus shall it be.

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:32.730
It's clean gone now.

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:35.960
Yeah.

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:38.110
Well, I'm glad, I'm glad.

00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:39.380
I don't really get it...

00:18:39.380 --> 00:18:41.870
...but being human, having your health is what's most important after all.

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:44.980
So, shall we go home now?

00:18:48.160 --> 00:18:51.990
Say, why're you so against going back to our own world?

00:18:53.790 --> 00:18:55.960
Is it 'cause I'm moving away?

00:18:55.960 --> 00:18:57.590
'Cause you'll be lonely?

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:02.800
I won't forget about you, even when I go to Hokkaido.

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:05.940
I know, I'll write! I'll call as often as I can too.

00:19:05.940 --> 00:19:09.810
And I'll visit Osaka during summer and winter breaks.

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:17.540
Knock it off already. Why're ya so quiet? It's creepy.

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:20.090
That's not all.

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:20.510
What?

00:19:21.890 --> 00:19:23.890
At first, that was the reason for it.

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:27.290
You were saying you were going to Hokkaido, so...

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:28.640
But...

00:19:29.300 --> 00:19:30.920
Now, there's more...

00:19:31.570 --> 00:19:34.690
That is, if we go back to our world...

00:19:35.840 --> 00:19:37.110
If we were to go back...

00:19:37.670 --> 00:19:38.320
What if we go back?

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:52.370
Come on, Sasshi, let's go home.

00:19:52.850 --> 00:19:56.410
No matter what happens, ya can't defy fate.

00:19:56.860 --> 00:19:59.380
Our original world's the best place for us. Right?

00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:05.400
You know how to get back, don't you?

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:07.370
Let's go back to our own world together. Okay?

00:20:11.210 --> 00:20:12.350
Please.

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:20.240
I understand.

00:20:23.180 --> 00:20:24.410
I'll do it.

00:20:33.930 --> 00:20:35.000
Okay, here we go!

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:35.960
Yeah!

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:45.050
All things extant in this world...

00:20:45.940 --> 00:20:49.100
...gods of Heaven, gods of Earth, let them be as they should be.

00:20:50.210 --> 00:20:52.100
All things extant in this world...

00:20:52.610 --> 00:20:55.840
...gods of Heaven, gods of Earth, let them be as they should be.

00:20:57.050 --> 00:20:58.710
All things extant in this world...

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:02.610
...gods of Heaven, gods of Earth, let them be as they should be.

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:05.190
Thus shall it be.

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:12.360
Hold on a second.

00:21:13.230 --> 00:21:16.290
I feel like we've gone through this before...

00:21:18.510 --> 00:21:19.560
Sasshi!

00:21:20.240 --> 00:21:21.340
Hey, Sasshi!

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:23.420
Look at me!

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:26.850
Hey, what IS that?!

00:21:26.850 --> 00:21:28.680
What's that stuff depicted in your eyes?!

00:21:29.080 --> 00:21:30.250
Dunno...

00:21:30.250 --> 00:21:32.810
Sasshi, you're thinking of some stupid fantasy again, aren't you?!

00:21:33.190 --> 00:21:35.140
What might you be talking about?

00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:38.660
Liar! Don't you still get it after everything I've said to you?!

00:21:38.660 --> 00:21:41.180
Maybe you should try dying a couple times?!

00:21:41.660 --> 00:21:43.300
I...

00:21:43.300 --> 00:21:45.170
I'm thinking of you...

00:21:45.170 --> 00:21:47.670
Thinking of me my butt! This isn't making me happy at all!

00:21:47.670 --> 00:21:48.970
You don't know anything!

00:21:48.970 --> 00:21:50.670
You're the one who doesn't get it!

00:21:50.670 --> 00:21:54.300
Is there nothing but stupid stuff crammed in your head?!

00:22:01.180 --> 00:22:03.590
Whoa, what're these? This is disgusting.

00:22:04.180 --> 00:22:06.810
Quit peeking into my head without my permission!

00:23:46.250 --> 00:23:47.090
Next time! Next time!

00:23:47.090 --> 00:23:48.590
Next time, next time, next time, next time, next time, next time!

00:23:47.390 --> 00:23:49.560
What the heck? You scared me there.

00:23:49.560 --> 00:23:51.690
Anyway, I'm going to do the preview before you butt in!

00:23:51.690 --> 00:23:52.590
Do whatever you want.

00:23:52.590 --> 00:23:54.230
Come on, hurry up. You're gonna run out of time again.

00:23:54.230 --> 00:23:54.860
Oh, you're right.

00:23:54.860 --> 00:23:57.100
Let's see, Let's see, in the next Magical Shopping Arcade Abeno...

00:23:56.400 --> 00:23:59.200
Hi, it's Mune-mune!

00:23:58.100 --> 00:23:59.200
Oh, my.

00:23:59.200 --> 00:24:01.800
I didn't have many scenes this time, so I'm visiting!

00:24:01.800 --> 00:24:03.440
No, no, no, no, I'm going to do the preview now and...

00:24:03.440 --> 00:24:07.370
Preview?! Oh, I'll do it! I wanna do the preview!

00:24:06.110 --> 00:24:07.370
No, like I said, I'm...

00:24:07.370 --> 00:24:09.880
Look forward to the next episode of Magical Shopping Arcade Abenobashi!

00:24:09.880 --> 00:24:12.450
See you! Watch us!

00:24:12.450 --> 00:24:15.020
I'm gonna turn bad someday, damn it!
